  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1768907334_8536571_46a2972e1a8250344fc86a6794d46dc0.jpg",
  "description": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Hi there!</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">We are looking for lovers of all things cute and unique to represent our brand.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Commison is starting at a fixed rate of 20%, but we are open to review this over the time of our collaboration.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>About us</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(59, 65, 79); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Robin Valley creates adorable and unique accessories from cherry wood. Inspired by nature, our designs range from red pandas to axolotls and more! Everyone deserves to have accessories that are special to them. That's why we're passionate about creating new designs every week, with over 400 to date.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(59, 65, 79); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">The quality of our work is something we take pride in. The intricate details produced on a centimetre square of wood take our designs to the next level. We believe that accessories should not compromise comfort!&nbsp; Cherry wood is extremely lightweight, making our earrings comfortable to wear all day.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 15px; color: rgb(59, 65, 79); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Robin Valley is committed to being environmentally conscious. The natural biodegradability of cherry wood makes it a great alternative to plastic fashion jewellery. To reduce single-use plastics, we package our products with recyclable materials.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">We look forward to working with you.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Love,&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Robin Valley Team</span></p>",
